# Unity Application UI Spec (5 screens)

Applies `.cursor/rules/design-system.mdc` to in-app screens.

**Nav:** persistent left-edge rail (5 icons, `--field`). Active icon `--lock-cyan`; inactive 40% gray.
Screen changes: cross-fade only, ≤200ms, no slide/bounce.

**Shared state:** every screen reads the same telemetry/config objects. Empty states when data
does not exist yet — never placeholder numbers. Mission Setup preview uses the same world as Live/Stress.

## Screen 1 — Mission Setup
Two-column: 35% `--field` config (Target, Camera, Disturbance presets NOMINAL/DIFFICULT/SEVERE/RECOVERY/ADVERSARIAL,
algorithm multi-select B0-Naive / B1-Classical / B2-Neural / Ours). 65% live 3D preview of the same world.
Section labels: Space Grotesk, all-caps, small, `--lock-cyan`. Numeric inputs: monospace.
Primary: `RUN` bottom-right, `--lock-cyan` fill → cross-fade to Screen 2.

## Screen 2 — Live Simulation
Full-viewport 3D; HUD on translucent `--field` (~85% opacity). HUD panels do not move.
Top-left Mode Manager: SEARCH → ACQUIRE → TRACK → DEGRADED → REACQUIRE. Active node filled
(TRACK `--confirm-green`, DEGRADED `--disturbance-amber`, REACQUIRE `--lost-red`, SEARCH/ACQUIRE `--lock-cyan`);
inactive outline-only. Top-right live metrics (angular error, FPS, latency ms) — replace values, no tweening.
Bottom: last ~8 timestamped events; oldest fades.

## Screen 3 — Tracking Console
Three stacked `--field` panels: (1) state vector `[θx, θy, ωx, ωy, ax, ay]` monospace grid with units;
(2) angular-space covariance ellipse, `--lock-cyan`, fill opacity = confidence — not a spinner;
(3) actual trajectory solid `--lock-cyan` vs predicted dashed/dimmer.

## Screen 4 — Stress Lab
Left: disturbance sliders (vibration, sensor noise, motion blur, intensity fluctuation, occlusion,
false distractors, actuator latency). Non-zero labels `--disturbance-amber`. Right: same live 3D as Screen 2.
Top presets set all sliders; manual change deselects preset → "Custom".

## Screen 5 — Benchmark Lab
Config row: same algorithm checkboxes, trial count (default 500), `RUN N TRIALS` with monospace `247 / 500`
(no generic progress bar). Results table: Ours better = `--confirm-green`, worse = `--lost-red` — only here.
Include robustness envelope plot. Failure replay list with `REPLAY` → Screen 2 seeded trial.
Empty: "No runs yet — configure and press RUN".
